1
00:00:14,064 --> 00:00:19,340
Salut, Marinette ! Bienvenue chez moi !
Hi, Marinette! Welcome to my home!

2
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:24,212
Merci ! Tu veux jouer à un jeu ?
Thanks! Do you want to play a game?

3
00:00:24,312 --> 00:00:28,988
Oui. Tu préfères le jeu ou un autre ?
Yes. Do you prefer the game or another one?

4
00:00:29,088 --> 00:00:31,964
Je préfère le jeu.
I prefer the game.

5
00:00:32,064 --> 00:00:36,500
D'accord. Tu veux commencer ?
Okay. Do you want to start?

6
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:39,932
Oui, mais comment on joue ?
Yes, but how do we play?

7
00:00:40,032 --> 00:00:43,724
Je peux expliquer, si tu veux.
I can explain, if you want.

8
00:00:43,824 --> 00:00:48,524
Merci ! Nous jouons ensemble ?
Thanks! Shall we play together?

9
00:00:48,624 --> 00:00:51,596
Oui, bien sûr !
Yes, of course!
